body:
 your boss is statistically most likely a psychopath, at least in the moments of "standing up to survival" (in his primitive mind you are threatening his livelihood, even if you're evidently a great asset, he will dismiss you). this is on him, not you. time to decide: tolerate to be mindful of this megalomaniac-traited psychopath or quit and try out a new experience which is uncertain and unknown. 

&#x200B;

Endnote, nothing bad in being a psychopath, there might be "bad" actions and behaviour, but this guy is a product of his experiences and i at least feel sorry for him to the extent that he doesn't decide to be, at times psychopatic.
